{"records":[{"findings":[{"actual_failure":"With Git older than 2.39 or a changed spec directory, an adopted rebase classifies wording-only and no non-protected reviewer is asked.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0006","AC-0007"],"evidence_refs":["packs/core/.apm/skills/work-loop/scripts/_review_tiers.py"],"finding_id":"ADV-1","material":true,"observation":"A subject reached by an adopted reanchor that fails a rebase condition falls through to the delta check, whose path union is unchanged, so wording-only passes vacuously.","reachable_path":"_review_tiers._classify after _rebase returns False","rule_ref":"AC-0006","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"A changed table cell, heading, or command inside a nested fence classifies wording-only.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0004"],"evidence_refs":["packs/core/.apm/skills/work-loop/scripts/_review_tiers.py"],"finding_id":"ADV-2","material":true,"observation":"The Markdown scan treats a pipe table without a leading pipe, a setext heading and its underline, and code after an inner shorter fence inside a longer fence as plain prose.","reachable_path":"_review_tiers.scan_markdown via _wording_only_file","rule_ref":"AC-0004","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"review-cap can fire after zero repairs.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0023","AC-0024"],"evidence_refs":["packs/core/.apm/skills/work-loop/scripts/_supervisor_readiness.py"],"finding_id":"ADV-3","material":true,"observation":"Round counting counts any subject whose product changed after a subject with open findings, including one reached only by an adopted reanchor.","reachable_path":"_supervisor_readiness._rounds","rule_ref":"AC-0023","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"The AC-0002 read limit does not hold for the tree read.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0002"],"evidence_refs":["packs/core/.apm/skills/work-loop/scripts/_supervisor_commit.py"],"finding_id":"ADV-4","material":true,"observation":"The full-tree listing the classifier reads has